        "vessel_or_method": "aerobic slurry/reflux in mixed CH3CN/CH2Cl2; slow evaporation of filtrate",
        "workup_and_crystallization": "cooled, filtered; filtrate stood at room temperature ~2 weeks; crystals washed with CH3CN and CH2Cl2 (10 mL) and dried in air",
        "yield": "70 mg (34.4%, based on Tb)"
