      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Dc susceptibility at 1000 Oe shows χmT = 35.98 cm3 mol−1 K at 300 K, rising to 69.66 cm3 mol−1 K at 1.8 K, consistent with ferromagnetic CrIII–TbIII interactions. Ac susceptibility at zero dc field shows frequency-dependent χ″ (SMM-like slow relaxation); Ueff ≈ 17 K and τ0 = 7×10−9 s estimated from ln(χ″/χ′) vs 1/T because χ″ maxima lie below 1.8 K due to QTM.",
